WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.336
This lesson does not assume you can hear an alarm, see the diagram, crawl, or use stairs.

00:00:06.336 --> 00:00:12.815
USFA lists vibrating pads, flashing lights, or strobes if you cannot hear a standard alarm.

00:00:12.815 --> 00:00:16.518
Check that doorways work for a walker or wheelchair.

00:00:16.518 --> 00:00:20.291
Prefer a ground-floor room near an exit when you can.

00:00:20.291 --> 00:00:26.485
If you cannot get out, close the door, cover vents, call 9-1-1, and signal at a window.

00:00:26.485 --> 00:00:28.621
Plan extra help before a fire.

00:00:28.621 --> 00:00:31.896
This app cannot promise that help will arrive.
